Subject: [PATCH] Add explicit scenario targets and evidence choices

Leave auto-selected targets for the outer oracle-scenario runner to verify from the spell on the stack.

Co-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
